# Build context: only what the Dockerfile copies (requirements.lock, app/).
# Everything else is excluded so patient data, keys and local environments can
# never be baked into an image layer by accident.
*

!requirements.lock
!app/
app/**/__pycache__
app/data/
app/config/
app/output/
app/de_identification/keystore/
**/*.dcm
**/secured.json
